{% if not($answered) %}
No provider answered for {% $query %}. Symbol search across a workspace is served by the TypeScript language service, and a server that registers no provider for it returns nothing rather than an empty result — so this is unanswered, not absent. document_symbols answers for a file you can name, and search_code finds a declaration by meaning.
{% /if %}
