Only projects already loaded are searched, so this is absent from what has been opened, not from the repository. A name in a project nothing has touched reports nothing here, and an unloaded workspace answers nothing at all — asking anything semantic about a file in a project loads it, and the same query then answers. Use document_symbols when you know the file, or search_code to find it by meaning.
{% /if %}
